WEBVTT

00:13:56.496 --> 00:14:01.829
And, you know, I said, like, you have to
go test yourself to see who you are.

00:14:02.454 --> 00:14:06.871
And that's those rituals of rites of
passage are what what we've done

00:14:06.871 --> 00:14:10.496
as humans throughout all time, across
every culture and, you know,

00:14:10.496 --> 00:14:14.454
continents and so on and so forth.
We don't do that so much anymore.

00:14:14.454 --> 00:14:21.079
And I think it's a loss. I think most of
us would benefit from being asked to

00:14:21.412 --> 00:14:25.204
find out who we really are by being
put in uncomfortable circumstances

00:14:25.204 --> 00:14:26.662
or challenging circumstances.

00:14:27.537 --> 00:14:32.246
When I was doing my research on your
childhood and adolescence,